## UnifiedMQ S1 VM arguments (relx template input, see {vm_args_src, ...}).
## No {{...}} placeholders: `rebar3 shell` and `unified_mq/bin/unified_mq start`
## both consume this file as-is.

-name unified_mq@127.0.0.1
+C multi_scheduling
+sbwt none
+sbwtdcpu none
+sbwtdio none

## Message queue bounds: a runaway partition worker must be killed and restarted
## rather than absorbing an unbounded backlog.
+Q 1000000
+h 1000000

## Disk-based crash dump only on OOM, keeping restart behaviour deterministic.
+W disabled

## WAL fsync latency budget (ADR-007 L2) depends on scheduler pressure.
-env ERL_FULLSWEEP_AFTER 100
